msgctxt "Blueprints.BlueprintsStrings.STRING_BLUEPRINTS_SNAPSHOT_TOOLTIP"
msgid ""
"Take snapshot {0} \n"
"\n"
"Create a blueprint and quickly place it elsewhere while not cluttering your blueprint collection! \n"
"Snapshots do not persist between games or worlds."
msgstr ""
"Tomar instantánea {0} \n"
"\n"
"Crea un plano y colócalo rápidamente en otro lugar sin saturar tu colección de planos\n"
"Las instantáneas no se guardan entre partidas o mundos."

